Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Неге!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Саана
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...
